Truthfulness Emanation — Code of Honor (Xia) Shido; IQ is an Affinity Attribute. Affliction 1 (Based on Will +20%; Disadvantage: Truthfulness +5%; Area Effect 1 +50%; Emanation -20%; Always On -10%) [15].

Elven Bullshit Ricochet — Weapons (Weapon Discipline); Bow; Zen Archery. Extra Attack 1 (Multi-Strike +20%; Single Skill: Bow -20%; Only continuation of the same arrow after the previous target fails Dodge -20%) [20/level]. Each level adds one target.

Damage Attributes [20] — Esoteric Medicine; Pressure Secrets; DX is an Affinity Attribute. Pressure Points or Pressure Secrets may reduce ST, DX, IQ, or HT instead of their normal special effect. After the qualifying attack and skill roll, victim rolls HT; failure reduces the chosen attribute by 1 for hours equal to margin of failure, minimum 1. Losses stack with separate durations. ST or HT reduced to 0 causes death.

Unbounded Force [20] — ST is an Affinity Attribute; Power Blow; one Style weapon skill. While using Style weapons, ignore their maximum effective ST for damage, and they do not break merely because effective ST exceeds that maximum. Other breakage rules remain.

Last Stand — HT is an Affinity Attribute; Immovable Stance. Injury Tolerance (Damage Reduction 2; Physical Attacks Only -20%; Only at 0 HP or below -20%) [30]. Stops immediately above 0 HP; divisor is capped at 2 through Gaoshou.

Golden Dragon's Super Luck — Transformation; Innate Attack (Breath); IQ is an Affinity Attribute. Super Luck (Wishing +100%; Unreliable 11 -20%) [180].
